[doc]
Test that verifies include only including a file once.

To make it easier to manage macro dependencies, include was changed to
ensure a file is included without having to worry about it being
included multiple times.
[enddoc]

[config require=VAR]

[include ./include_once.luxinc]
[include include_once.luxinc]
[include ../test/include_once.luxinc]
[include include_once_nested.luxinc]
